{"seq":1,"slug":"lead-stage-crm-pipeline","title":"线索阶段管理（招商 CRM）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/bd-pipeline-negotiation/lead-stage-crm-pipeline","wordCount":1918,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"线索阶段管理-招商-crm\">线索阶段管理（招商 CRM）</h1><p>一个 BD 同时跟 60 个目标商家，团队十个人就是 600 条在途线索。如果没有一套状态机管着，管理者唯一的可见性是每周例会上每个人的口头汇报，而口头汇报天然倾向于把「聊过一次」说成「有戏」。招商 CRM 的存在不是为了记录，是为了提供<strong>一套无法被乐观解读的客观口径</strong>——让「这单到哪一步了」有一个不由 BD 自己定义的答案。</p>\n<p>本篇只讲平台招商场景下的管道设计，不涉及通用 CRM 的架构（那是另一类系统的主题）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-阶段定义与出口判据\">核心概念：阶段定义与出口判据</h2><p>销售管道的通用阶段模型在业界已经比较稳定（见 <a href=\"https://blog.hubspot.com/sales/sales-pipeline\">Sales pipeline</a>）：从线索生成、资格确认、首次接触、方案、谈判到成交或流失。但通用模型直接照搬到招商场景会失效，因为招商的「买家」是商家，而商家入驻有一种通用 CRM 没有的特殊复杂性：<strong>它同时是一个商业决策和一个合规流程</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"出口判据必须客观可验证\">出口判据必须客观可验证</h3><p>设计管道最重要的原则只有一条：<strong>每个阶段的出口判据必须是客观可验证的事件，而不是主观判断</strong>。<code>discovery_done</code> 无法被验证——BD 说做完了就是做完了；<code>written_requirement_list_received</code> 可以被验证——系统里有一份带日期的对方要求清单。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>出口判据（客观）</th>\n<th>常见的主观伪判据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>lead_in</td>\n<td>线索通过去重且分数过阈值</td>\n<td>「看起来是个好商家」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>contacted</td>\n<td>有一次已记录触达（邮件/通话/展会面谈）</td>\n<td>「发过资料」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>qualified</td>\n<td>拿到对方的<strong>经营现状与诉求</strong>（现平台、品类、期望市场）</td>\n<td>「对方挺有兴趣」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>proposal</td>\n<td>已提交<strong>政策包实例</strong>（带版本号）给对方</td>\n<td>「口头报过价」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>negotiating</td>\n<td>对方提出<strong>具体条款修改意见</strong>且已记录</td>\n<td>「在谈」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>committed</td>\n<td>对方书面确认入驻意向（邮件/签署 LOI）</td>\n<td>「基本定了」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>converted</td>\n<td>已生成注册邀约并进入风控审核交接</td>\n<td>「应该会注册」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>lost</td>\n<td>记录了<strong>具体的流失原因码</strong></td>\n<td>「不合适」</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>lost</code> 那一行的要求常被忽略：没有原因码的流失单等于把信息丢掉了。原因码（<code>price</code>、<code>category_not_fit</code>、<code>exclusivity_conflict</code>、<code>competitor_lockin</code>、<code>no_response</code>）是后续修正缺口模型与政策授权的最重要输入——如果某品类 40% 的流失原因是 <code>competitor_lockin</code>，说明需要更重的迁移吸引点，而不是让 BD 更努力。</p>\n<h3 id=\"阶段状态机\">阶段状态机</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;  [*] --&gt; lead_in&#10;  lead_in --&gt; contacted: 记录触达&#10;  contacted --&gt; qualified: 拿到诉求清单&#10;  qualified --&gt; proposal: 提交政策包实例&#10;  proposal --&gt; negotiating: 收到条款修改意见&#10;  negotiating --&gt; committed: 书面意向确认&#10;  committed --&gt; converted: 生成邀约并交接&#10;  proposal --&gt; lost: 原因码&#10;  negotiating --&gt; lost: 原因码&#10;  qualified --&gt; nurture: 无响应超期&#10;  nurture --&gt; contacted: 新意图事件&#10;  converted --&gt; [*]&#10;  lost --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n  [*] --&gt; lead_in\n  lead_in --&gt; contacted: 记录触达\n  contacted --&gt; qualified: 拿到诉求清单\n  qualified --&gt; proposal: 提交政策包实例\n  proposal --&gt; negotiating: 收到条款修改意见\n  negotiating --&gt; committed: 书面意向确认\n  committed --&gt; converted: 生成邀约并交接\n  proposal --&gt; lost: 原因码\n  negotiating --&gt; lost: 原因码\n  qualified --&gt; nurture: 无响应超期\n  nurture --&gt; contacted: 新意图事件\n  converted --&gt; [*]\n  lost --&gt; [*]</pre><p>这个状态机里有两个不那么显然的设计。第一，<strong><code>committed</code> 与 <code>converted</code> 是分开的</strong>：「对方书面同意」和「邀约真的发出去了」是两件事，中间可能有若干天的延迟，如果合并成一个阶段，管道数据会高估即将到手的成果。第二，<strong><code>nurture</code> 是一个真正的阶段而不是垃圾桶</strong>：它必须能被新意图事件重新激活（这依赖 <a href=\"../recruit-planning-target/target-brand-lead-pool\">目标品牌与商家线索库</a> 的意图分重算），否则线索一旦进入 nurture 就永久沉底。</p>\n<h2 id=\"阶段停留与流失的度量\">阶段停留与流失的度量</h2><p>有了状态机，就能算出招商管理里最有用的两个派生指标：<strong>阶段停留时长</strong>与<strong>阶段转化率</strong>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH stage_events AS (&#10;  SELECT lead_id, to_stage, occurred_at,&#10;         lag(to_stage)  OVER (PARTITION BY lead_id ORDER BY occurred_at) AS from_stage,&#10;         lag(occurred_at) OVER (PARTITION BY lead_id ORDER BY occurred_at) AS prev_at&#10;  FROM lead_stage_event&#10;  WHERE occurred_at &gt;= now() - interval &#39;180 days&#39;&#10;)&#10;SELECT from_stage,&#10;       count(*)                                                        AS exits,&#10;       count(*) FILTER (WHERE to_stage = &#39;lost&#39;)                        AS lost,&#10;       round(count(*) FILTER (WHERE to_stage = &#39;lost&#39;)::numeric&#10;             / nullif(count(*), 0), 3)                                 AS lost_rate,&#10;       percentile_cont(0.5) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY extract(epoch FROM occurred_at - prev_at)/86400)&#10;                                                                       AS median_days_in_stage&#10;FROM stage_events&#10;WHERE from_stage IS NOT NULL&#10;GROUP BY from_stage&#10;ORDER BY lost_rate DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stage_events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lead_id, to_stage, occurred_at,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         lag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(to_stage)  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lead_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> occurred_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_stage,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">         lag</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(occurred_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">OVER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lead_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> occurred_at) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev_at</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lead_stage_event</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> occurred_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> interval </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'180 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_stage,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> exits,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> to_stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'lost'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lost,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       round</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> to_stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'lost'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)::</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">numeric</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             /</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nullif</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">count</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)                                 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lost_rate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       percentile_cont</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITHIN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> GROUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> extract(epoch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> occurred_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prev_at)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">86400</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                                                                       AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> median_days_in_stage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stage_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IS NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> from_stage</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lost_rate </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>median_days_in_stage</code> 用中位数而不是均值，是因为销售阶段的停留时长分布是<strong>重尾</strong>的：大部分线索几天就推进，少数会卡几个月。均值会被那几条长尾拉高到毫无参考价值的程度。</p>\n<h3 id=\"小样本下的转化率不可直接用于预测\">小样本下的转化率不可直接用于预测</h3><p>这是招商管道里最容易被误用的一点。一个季度内，<code>negotiating → committed</code> 可能只有 12 次尝试，其中 5 次成功。这个 41.7% 的<strong>样本估计</strong>的 95% 置信区间大致是 [15%, 72%]——宽到无法支撑任何决策。用二项比例的 Wald 区间估算：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mtext>Wald</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>±</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>p</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mi>n</mi></mfrac></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">CI_{\\text{Wald}} = \\hat{p} \\pm z_{1-\\alpha/2}\\sqrt{\\frac{\\hat{p}(1-\\hat{p})}{n}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Wald</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">±</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.44em;vertical-align:-0.7356em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.7044em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-4.4em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1944em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.6644em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:2.48em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"2.48em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 2592\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M424,2478\nc-1.3,-0.7,-38.5,-172,-111.5,-514c-73,-342,-109.8,-513.3,-110.5,-514\nc0,-2,-10.7,14.3,-32,49c-4.7,7.3,-9.8,15.7,-15.5,25c-5.7,9.3,-9.8,16,-12.5,20\ns-5,7,-5,7c-4,-3.3,-8.3,-7.7,-13,-13s-13,-13,-13,-13s76,-122,76,-122s77,-121,77,-121\ns209,968,209,968c0,-2,84.7,-361.7,254,-1079c169.3,-717.3,254.7,-1077.7,256,-1081\nl0 -0c4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000\nv40H1014.6\ns-87.3,378.7,-272.6,1166c-185.3,787.3,-279.3,1182.3,-282,1185\nc-2,6,-10,9,-24,9\nc-8,0,-12,-0.7,-12,-2z M1001 80\nh400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7356em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 小时这个区间会「越界」（下界为负、上界超过 1），Wilson 区间因为不对称的构造能避免这个问题，也因此在 A/B 与小样本场景下更被推荐（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Binomial_proportion_confidence_interval\">Binomial proportion confidence interval</a>）。实践中的做法不是精确算区间，而是设一个<strong>样本量下限</strong>：低于该下限的阶段转化率只做展示、不用于加权预测，并在看板上明确标注。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加权管道与覆盖倍数\">加权管道与覆盖倍数</h2><p>管理层真正想看的是一个数：这个季度大概能签多少。这需要把在途线索按阶段权重折算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"权重来自历史实际转化率\">权重来自历史实际转化率</h3><p>各阶段的权重不能拍脑袋，必须用历史实际转化率回填，并定期（如每月）重算。这形成一条闭环：当某个阶段的真实转化率提升，权重上调，所需覆盖倍数下降。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;stage_weights&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;version&quot;: &quot;2026Q3-w2&quot;,&#10;    &quot;computed_at&quot;: &quot;2026-07-12T00:00:00Z&quot;,&#10;    &quot;source&quot;: &quot;rolling_12m_actual_conversion&quot;,&#10;    &quot;weights&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;lead_in&quot;: 0.02,&#10;      &quot;contacted&quot;: 0.06,&#10;      &quot;qualified&quot;: 0.15,&#10;      &quot;proposal&quot;: 0.28,&#10;      &quot;negotiating&quot;: 0.45,&#10;      &quot;committed&quot;: 0.8&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;min_sample_n&quot;: 30,&#10;    &quot;excluded_low_sample_stages&quot;: [&quot;committed&quot;]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"stage_weights\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026Q3-w2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"computed_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-07-12T00:00:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"source\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"rolling_12m_actual_conversion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"weights\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"lead_in\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.02</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"contacted\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.06</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"qualified\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"proposal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.28</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"negotiating\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.45</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"committed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.8</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"min_sample_n\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"excluded_low_sample_stages\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"committed\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>excluded_low_sample_stages</code> 记录了那些样本不足、权重沿用上一期的阶段。把这个信息显式写进配置而不是悄悄处理，是为了让看板能诚实地显示「这个数字里有一段是猜的」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"覆盖倍数\">覆盖倍数</h3><p>加权管道额除以季度目标即覆盖倍数。业界常引用 3 倍作为健康水位，但<strong>这个数字必须由本团队自己的历史赢率反推</strong>，而不是照抄：如果从 <code>qualified</code> 到 <code>converted</code> 的历史转化率是 12%，那么每 1 元目标需要约 8.3 元的 <code>qualified</code> 阶段管道额——3 倍对它来说远远不够。把这条链算清楚，才能回答「我们的管道够不够」这个每周都会被问的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"管道卫生的死角\">管道卫生的死角</h2><p>管道管理最容易腐坏的地方不是阶段定义，而是<strong>退出机制</strong>。没有强制退出规则的管道会持续膨胀，最终失去信号价值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>腐坏形态</th>\n<th>表现</th>\n<th>强制规则</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>僵尸线索</td>\n<td>超过 N 天无任何记录的活跃线索</td>\n<td>自动转 <code>nurture</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乐观挂单</td>\n<td>长期停在 <code>negotiating</code> 无实质进展</td>\n<td>要求记录最近一次对方反馈的日期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>占坑</td>\n<td>BD 屯积线索不跟进</td>\n<td>每人活跃线索上限 + 超期回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>假成交</td>\n<td><code>committed</code> 后长期不 <code>converted</code></td>\n<td>按周统计 <code>committed</code> 老化队列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「假成交」这一项值得强调：<code>committed</code> 阶段最容易变成心理安慰区——BD 把不确定的单子推到这个阶段来规避 <code>lost</code> 的难看。因此必须把 <code>committed → converted</code> 的<strong>老化队列</strong>单独做成一列看板，按天龄排序。当这个队列持续增长时，问题通常不在 BD，而在<strong>交接环节</strong>：（<a href=\"../invite-conversion-handoff/recruit-to-onboarding-handoff\">招商到入驻风控审核的交接</a>）里如果字段不全、退回率过高，<code>committed</code> 就会积压。管道指标必须和交接指标一起看，否则会误判为 BD 执行力问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>阶段出口判据必须是客观可验证的事件；<code>lost</code> 必须记录原因码，它是修正缺口模型与政策授权的关键输入。</li>\n<li><code>committed</code> 与 <code>converted</code> 分开，<code>nurture</code> 是能被重新激活的真实阶段而非垃圾桶。</li>\n<li>阶段停留用中位数而非均值（重尾分布），阶段转化率在样本量不足时只展示不用于预测。</li>\n<li>加权管道的权重来自滚动历史实际转化率并定期重算，样本不足的阶段必须显式标注。</li>\n<li>覆盖倍数由本团队赢率反推，不照抄行业常数。</li>\n<li>管道腐坏的防线在退出机制：僵尸线索回收、乐观挂单要求反馈日期、<code>committed</code> 老化队列必须和交接受阻情况联看。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>管道解决「谈得动不动」，下一篇 <a href=\"recruit-policy-incentive-pkg\">招商政策与费率/补贴谈判包</a> 解决「拿什么谈」。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"线索阶段管理（招商 CRM）","id":"线索阶段管理-招商-crm"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：阶段定义与出口判据","id":"核心概念-阶段定义与出口判据"},{"level":3,"text":"出口判据必须客观可验证","id":"出口判据必须客观可验证"},{"level":3,"text":"阶段状态机","id":"阶段状态机"},{"level":2,"text":"阶段停留与流失的度量","id":"阶段停留与流失的度量"},{"level":3,"text":"小样本下的转化率不可直接用于预测","id":"小样本下的转化率不可直接用于预测"},{"level":2,"text":"加权管道与覆盖倍数","id":"加权管道与覆盖倍数"},{"level":3,"text":"权重来自历史实际转化率","id":"权重来自历史实际转化率"},{"level":3,"text":"覆盖倍数","id":"覆盖倍数"},{"level":2,"text":"管道卫生的死角","id":"管道卫生的死角"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"竞品商家情报与迁移吸引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/recruit-planning-target/competitor-merchant-intel"},"next":{"title":"招商政策与费率/补贴谈判包","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/platform-global-merchant-recruitment/bd-pipeline-negotiation/recruit-policy-incentive-pkg"}}